.subckt ac_diff_probe INP OUTN INN OUTP  vcm=0.75 vac=0.1
*.iopin OUTN
*.iopin INP
*.iopin OUTP
*.iopin INN
xprobe1 OUTN INP ac_probe vcm={vcm} vac={vac}
xprobe2 OUTP INN ac_probe vcm={vcm} vac=-{vac}
.ends


* expanding   symbol:  ac_probe/ac_probe.sym # of pins=2
** sym_path: /run/media/yacinesot/My_Files/XschemDesigns/designs/Chipalooza2/schema/ac_probe/ac_probe.sym
** sch_path: /run/media/yacinesot/My_Files/XschemDesigns/designs/Chipalooza2/schema/ac_probe/ac_probe.sch
.subckt ac_probe OUT IN  vcm=0.75 vac=0.01

*.iopin IN
*.iopin OUT
C1 0 IN 1
V1 IN 0 {vcm} ac {vac}
R1 OUT IN 1G
.ends

.end
